{"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1","entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"da7d31d0129575a63a602fdbda2c421c1ec72b9ad6fa1b758322eecd14b6c747","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1611a3418359c0efc22d206c2e7f6b5befbb11c49aa88f74149bc4039aa7a14b","logical_entry_identity":"1da4e6a9614098aa613b4c0573ba268c9d044361d5d8f6e49abb4dd10d7f4eb2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Systematically find the weaknesses in your opponents' physical resists, at the cost of 10%% of your physical damage.  Each time you hit an opponent with a melee attack, you reduce their physical resistance by 5%%, up to a maximum of %d%%.\n\t\t","source_tag":"tformat","target":"系统性地找出对手物理抗性的弱点，代价是你的物理伤害降低 10%%。每次你的近战攻击命中对手时，你会使其物理抗性降低 5%%，最多降低 %d%%。\n\t\t"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"46d65a510a99d816a3031e98fbf58a8823860b0a0726c940d8b5ab625ad929d0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"78f2404e70ac2f1205765ce22befa1fbe468f61dcba39b0c00ac6df89e19f3b1","logical_entry_identity":"23d4d825ca84131537c85d5b6e027ca38154512c36e0e163dd965ac2426ada40","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#ORCHID#You claim the head of %s, giving pause to all foes on the level.","source_tag":"say","target":"#ORCHID#你取下了 %s 的首级，令本层所有敌人为之迟疑。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f9a68f5f69144b4f07b6573671b58158fa783db96bbf8ef759b18a2f83cc7d49","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c4b55512aaaa8a0bea5f88cee0047ab5fe0eef0d7f14beaebde9b1cd3d129841","logical_entry_identity":"5a3d128a912010aced252ff09e60aefd9e3929d22281a307da8318111a91d4a1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD#Effect resistance chance#LAST#\nThis represents your chance to completely resist this specific effect.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD#效果抵抗几率#LAST#\n表示你完全抵抗该特定效果的几率。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"af90db44484afa3c8a91df0ae5a33b8fd22ccb3c3f83aa6dfd8b0c1a21cbc29c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"caba56ae037a6fa8ca8fd4dd2903490175b58b7a22b1f93678f88389463fd753","logical_entry_identity":"a2c012d89dcd2bc10805c8e6f74c52d432c16c0187b581a27ec13201d1628b57","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Forge a guardian from your thoughts alone.  Your guardian's primary stat will be improved by %d, its two secondary stats by %d, and it will have Magic, Cunning, and Willpower equal to your own.\n\t\tAt talent level one, you may forge a mighty bowman clad in leather armor; at level three a powerful warrior wielding a two-handed weapon; and at level five a strong defender using a sword and shield.\n\t\tThought forms can only be maintained up to a range of %d, and will rematerialize next to you if this range is exceeded.\n\t\tOnly one thought-form may be active at a time, and the stat bonuses will improve with your Mindpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"仅凭思维塑造一名守护者。守护者的主属性会增加 %d，两项副属性各增加 %d，并且其魔力、灵巧和意志将分别等同于你的相应属性。\n\t\t技能等级 1 时，你可以塑造一名身着皮甲的威猛弓箭手；等级 3 时，塑造一名手持双手武器的强大战士；等级 5 时，塑造一名使用剑盾的强健盾战士。\n\t\t思维形态只能维持在 %d 码范围内，超出此范围时会在你身边重新实体化。\n\t\t同一时间只能有一种思维形态处于激活状态，属性加成会随你的精神强度提高。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"969d52c053f6506fe4d1e8e2990bc81e2aeaa463da08b45b001143e6e8414f68","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d54826fb60670d4b8aeeb4ab3f9b871bad359f7af7c00ce1c6751d4e0688d127","logical_entry_identity":"623cbf2137301983062946d0da4db58ca5973a0d842fd4050fb5c564cae3f3dd","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD#Congratulations !#WHITE#\n\nYou have completed this small tutorial, and should now know the basics of ToME4. You are ready to step forward into the world to find glory, treasures and be mercilessly slaughtered by hordes of creatures you thought you could handle!\nDuring this tutorial some creatures were adjusted to the need of the teachings, beware, in the real world trolls are not usually this nice!\n\nIf you need a reminder of which key does what, you can access the game menu by pressing #GOLD#Escape#WHITE# and checking the key binds (you can also adjust them to your needs).\n\nAs this is probably your first time with the game you will find there is a limited number of races and classes available to play, many many more do exist but you will unlock them while playing.\n\nNow go boldly and remember: #GOLD#Have fun!#WHITE#\nPress Escape, save & exit and create a new character!\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD#恭喜你！#WHITE#\n\n你完成了这个简单教程，应该已经了解 ToME4 的基础。现在你已准备好踏入这个世界，寻找荣耀与财富，并被一群你自以为能对付的怪物无情屠杀！\n在教程中，一些生物为了配合教学进行了调整；记住，在真实世界里，巨魔通常不会这么友善！\n\n如果你想知道快捷键的功能，你可以按 #GOLD#Esc#WHITE#键进入游戏菜单检查按键设定(你也可以根据你的需要改变设置)。\n\n也许这是你第一次玩这个游戏，你会发现可供游玩的种族和职业数量有限；游戏中还存在许多其他种族和职业，你会在游戏过程中解锁它们。\n\n现在，勇敢前进并记住：#GOLD#好好享受游戏的乐趣！#WHITE#\n请按下 Esc 键，保存并退出游戏，建立一个新的角色吧！\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"27af595a9232d17ac6e6923ce54eb0c763ab30fa37fa035580696bd50d2cdd91","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f363751858473caaeccf70df85612bf2bfe1d9015aec1684687b4f934f3c78ae","logical_entry_identity":"e380f84ccb72d95ca93e7bfe9b935cb9f9b6231f31bf1c43eeb6f52867165f14","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"blighted","source_tag":"entity keyword","target":"枯萎"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3a2f6fc9d7851f359605519b3cabf06618c0fc55118f294f0b5e7e8d78a0509c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f36a77c67030a4ae4a985497a95f1efd368e8e9b5215ff60a484473f5c279299","logical_entry_identity":"992d04e63c4a535e30983a4f733586a1bb2cf2423cb2ef0cdc0a154d39587c28","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#Target# is being crushed.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target#被击碎。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"cf5fe581bf7b7e1906b93a19105e5521883e6bb84e7ed7b8882b371774a793b3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f36cf4fa5bb0b3cec695f691d5e3041b0a8be7b0527122e37d573f8c0eae9812","logical_entry_identity":"39bb9ed2e52615f28f90e333c5f788b1620aec22204569c0c881b3f84123448d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_RED#You've altered your destiny and will not be pulled into the past.","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"#LIGHT_RED#你改变了你的命运，将不会被拉回过去。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ec561ad3d8566d744594348d6e0867750c2a22731ccd4e8d0937141885c4d59a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f36d5a120e253fe98d1957ab73f634a1982e1ce7eb4ceb357aff31d13ae6aa2d","logical_entry_identity":"2c18971186e64bd295a4df094eca6dd73adb8adcd2a8ef5bb01c92267ccd41f8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Blood-Letter","source_tag":"entity name","target":"放血者"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"776436d008bb47d34db6b3616b288252074929a4c6d817baa6364969660abe5b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f36e992152f264a525d9ae9201d3f1224e8026c6507b95fc7b52790cbf2db1e7","logical_entry_identity":"ce29d4b8b2f779838e324e3611efef02f6dca553aed803133af3428a92bd9373","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Spectral Sight","source_tag":"talent name","target":"幽灵视野"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"15ea6649ad1d8034c9712f002948df21954740b8c23af706689340e0ced11ab4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f36ec8bc059aacc2363213bf1eb57d5a7efad368b804140ac25ac2f0e3bd2d24","logical_entry_identity":"4615f948ca52c8455113b15dafdb6ef5c546b345bd2a17a172d798bda41c0863","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Strength defines your character's ability to apply physical force. It increases your melee damage, damage done with heavy weapons, your chance to resist physical effects, and carrying capacity.","source_tag":"_t","target":"力量属性影响你的角色的物理能力，提升力量可以提高物理强度，提高使用重型武器造成的伤害，提高物理豁免，同时提高你的负重量。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"85444f39a2905d878a0cb4f8248c707e8f443dfe8601f0f01bda26dc2f7cade2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f37171a372ea58f3781c1d48cbc653e11f6a15f0bedc4e95806faf479e6375a6","logical_entry_identity":"adb3d45ecc54745048081c0e6bb98a34f3932d9d862b83cf1cd062075a31c541","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Icy Kill","source_tag":"entity name","target":"冰冷杀戮"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0093d80d262e5987d11fc200e86cf8fe772e89a3c8ca35855ec0ef4319fe3c79","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f371dd0fe6c237533de00107588e13e961bb695e0f3394550a0373fff758612e","logical_entry_identity":"ebe613ed1e04460869b875c6909f73b1d2cc0771e4c1b499e9cf290bb70f3257","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Treachery! During a patrol around the outskirts of the High Peak I witnessed two orcs - the envoys from our supposed \"master\" - talking in secret. Remaining to watch them, I beheld as their orcish features sloughed from their bodies, revealing a pair of human wizards! Humans! To think that our great pride has been deceived in such a manner! I should have crushed their skulls there and then. However, mages can be crafty, so I left them to their scheming.\n\nEven now the blood runs hot! What would Garkul, our mighty berserker king, think if he saw our great race bending before humans?! Many times I have entertained the idea of taking a group of my finest warriors and ending this folly, but... loathsome as it is, I must use tact. A rebellion would leave my pride weakened, easy prey. That bone-picker Rak'Shor and his unnatural creations have dreamed of my death (and subsequent dominion) for years, I know this to be true. This conundrum frustrates and confuses! ... At least we are agreed on one matter - the total destruction of those sun-worshipping dogs of the Gates of Morning...","source_tag":"_t","target":"背叛！在巅峰外围巡逻时，我目睹了两名兽人——来自我们所谓“主人”的使者——正在秘密交谈。我继续暗中观察，竟眼睁睁看着他们的兽人面貌从身上层层剥落，露出了两个人类法师！人类！想想看，我们伟大的部落竟然受到了这般蒙骗！我本该当场砸碎他们的头骨。然而法师往往诡计多端，所以我暂时任由他们继续阴谋。\n\n直到此刻我的热血仍在沸腾！如果我们强大的狂战士之王加库尔看到我们伟大的种族在人类面前卑躬屈膝，他会怎么想？！许多次我都动过念头，想带上一队最精锐的战士去终结这场闹剧，但是……尽管令人作呕，我必须讲究策略。起兵反抗会让我的部落元气大伤，沦为易于下手的猎物。那个拾骨者拉克·肖和他那些违背自然的造物多年来一直梦想着我死，然后顺势夺权；我很清楚这是事实。这道难题令人焦躁又困惑！……至少我们在某一件事上达成了一致——彻底毁灭晨曦之门那些崇拜太阳的走狗们……"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"000126a543f9b7093e4e867bb660c72c26d9b990aa80d445b197d79f06d4973e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f3738dc1e1a34c768d27bdb70727e221d28e7f6bb076ef3edf1e626289da3843","logical_entry_identity":"daf467902718de62bd2ea8efa5a92494f0a9ee23766549ae3f34fa625ace831c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Substantially toughens and hastes one target for %d turns.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"显著强化和加速目标 %d 回合。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"139d788647ba926b69429c4df8ef34601c4d910392d57c37086d325b45706f81","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f3756e2f2d7f9cf289f5d069c1921b1c338a6f919c993b75ae50ed92f8b46de7","logical_entry_identity":"7ac5d02d34408ad1c168c5767b404635136021943063ee5d267f51f85003ba36","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Standby","source_tag":"_t","target":"乖乖站好"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"efccfbcacf4461e05f085c996108d1dcebbaaaae917b658b4408725ccc3a6e77","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f3760ed56d0d25a10ad1c9f588f3a67cde12fb3bdc5dd3582d663521ed807f0f","logical_entry_identity":"1cac8b9633df719ddf25aa750b7025ebad71b17a64f644ffffc3fffa724571de","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You feel two unconnected psionic channels on this item.","source_tag":"_t","target":"你感到这件物品上有两条尚未连通的灵能通道。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ceeecdabb091b43ea76db22a3c09bdd1ff442dde5aa71446311f9e1a1e74d925","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f37f2d4a4a19b496294797c55adc7abbed87b1eda90d3b9993897f12f096ec65","logical_entry_identity":"41267ce9d4387e0eff14660aceab61f419bf075c4ccf9ebf7ced815509891dec","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Forge a defender wielding a sword and shield from your thoughts.  The solider learns Armor Training, Weapon Mastery, Combat Accuracy, Shield Pummel, and Shield Wall as it levels up, and has +%d Strength, +%d Dexterity, and +%d Constitution.\n\t\tActivating this talent will put all other thought-forms on cooldown.\n\t\tThe stat bonuses will improve with your Mindpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你从脑海里召唤出一位手持剑盾的精神体盾战士。当精神体盾战士到达对应等级时可习得护甲掌握、武器掌握、强化命中、盾牌连击和盾墙，并且可增加 %d 点力量、%d 点敏捷和 %d 体质。\n\t\t激活此技能会使其他思维形态技能进入冷却。\n\t\t属性增益受精神强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"80e56572f251a3b102627d195994f11fbd5d094f82a26e459143371711fb0722","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f38000a11e94